  "content": "<div><br></div><div><!--StartFragment--><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-58b2e389-7fff-f535-566f-d8e9e2cbc34d\"><h2><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font color=\"#ffffff\">Summary of how Wild Shape works:</font></span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font color=\"#ffffff\">While in animal form:</font></span></p><ul><li><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-58b2e389-7fff-f535-566f-d8e9e2cbc34d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Gain Temporary HP equal to your Druid level.</span></span></li><li><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-58b2e389-7fff-f535-566f-d8e9e2cbc34d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">You can speak.</span></span></li><li><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-58b2e389-7fff-f535-566f-d8e9e2cbc34d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">You cannot cast spells, but can keep concentration on spells already cast.</span></span></li><li><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-58b2e389-7fff-f535-566f-d8e9e2cbc34d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">You choose if your equipment is absorbed, worn, or dropped.</span></span></li><li><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-58b2e389-7fff-f535-566f-d8e9e2cbc34d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">You retain your creature type; HP; Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores; class/race features; languages; feats; skill and save numbers unless the animal's is higher.</span></span></li><li><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-58b2e389-7fff-f535-566f-d8e9e2cbc34d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">For everything else, use the animal's stats.</span></span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><br></font></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font color=\"#ffffff\">OR spend a Wild Shape to do your \"Symbiotic Entity\" from your Spore Circle Druid class.</font></span></p><font color=\"#ffffff\"><br><br></font><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" align=\"left\"><table style=\"border:none;border-collapse:collapse;\"><colgroup><col width=\"102\"><col width=\"111\"><col width=\"68\"><col width=\"77\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:2.3760000000000003pt\"><td style=\"border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(183, 183, 183); vertical-align: middle; padding: 4.968pt